window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Trial Worlds may have faded into oblivion, but the saga of Kai Arnhard continues.</b></p> <p>Having completed the extensive preparations, the Eternal Path Temple, together with its empire, finally left the dimension of the Heavenly Exaltation Pagoda. Now they have to start over. Once more, they will have to fight for their place in the Ecumene and prove their worth.</p> <p>The long-awaited reunion with his sister Julie is closer than ever, but to get to her, Kai will first have to meet with the powerful Otrey Corporation and face the New Army of Truth, led by the revived Or'Drok Okka Yashnir.</p> <p>Will he survive these encounters? Will his unwavering determination be enough to achieve his goal in this cruel world where strength and skill reign supreme?</p> <p>Once again, Kai will have to do his best to overcome the challenges in the world ruled by the art of cultivation!</p>"; 
